  Use a registry identity without invented CAS, purity or has-part constituents. Supplier/catalog
  and purity are unspecified, limiting chemical equivalence but not botanical preparation
  scope. Raw source spellings are retained in case evidence and this source scope;
  no new globally resolving source-local alias is added. Full-owner publication approval
  and all source-specific holds remain pending.'
